  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HQ-SF-2023-IACHR HUMAN RIGHTS INTER AMERICAN HUMAN JUSTICE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to increase access to the Inter-American justice system, which will guarantee reparations to victims who have access to the Inter-American system, specially of those historically excluded and those whose processes have been delayed due to the IACHR historical backlog. The petitions addressed within the framework of this project will be gross human rights violations related to right to life, due process, torture and inhumane treatment, forced disappearances, massacre, forced labour, human trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
